{"sourceUrl":"http://smee.whut.edu.cn/tzgg/yggg/202609/t20260916_1417761.shtml","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:54:10.265100+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"http://smee.whut.edu.cn/tzgg/yggg/202609/t20260916_1417761.shtml","html":"<div>\n<p>\n\n</p>\n<div><h2><span>一、申请条件</span></h2><p><span>1.<span>符合学校规定的推免生申请基本条件。</span></span></p><p><span>2.<span>本科期间学习成绩优良、品德表现良好，无违纪处分记录。</span></span></p><p><span>3.</span><span>能</span><span><span>取得就读高校推荐免试资格的</span>2027<span>届应届本科毕业生。</span></span></p><p><span>4.<span>入学前须取得本科毕业证书和学士学位证书。</span></span></p><p><span>5.<span>申请直接攻读博士学位者，应具有较强的科研创新能力和培养潜力</span></span><span>，在报名前与拟报考导师联系，取得导师同意后报考，并致电备案。</span></p><p><span><span>6.</span><span>本科毕业专业：机械类、仪器类、工业工程类、电气类、电子信息类、自动化类、计算机类、材料类、能源动力类、轻工类、航空航天类、农业工程类等理工科相关专业。</span></span></p><h2><span><span>二、招生类别和招生人数</span></span></h2><h3><span>（一）本科直博生</span></h3><div><table><tbody><tr><td><p><strong><span>序号</span></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span>专业名称</span></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span>专业代码</span></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span>学习形式</span></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span>拟招生人数</span></strong></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span>1</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>080200</span></span></p></td><td><p><span>机械工程</span></p></td><td><p><span>全日制</span></p></td><td><p><span><span>6</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span>2</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>080400</span></span></p></td><td><p><span>仪器科学与技术</span></p></td><td><p><span>全日制</span></p></td><td><p><span><span>3</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>合计</span></p></td><td colspan=\"3\"><br/></td><td><p><span><span>9</span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p><span><span>注：本科直博生实际招生人数可根据生源情况适当调整。</span></span></p><h3><span><span>（二）硕士研究生</span></span></h3><div><table><tbody><tr><td><p><strong><span>序号</span></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span>专业名称</span></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span>专业代码</span></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span>学习形式</span></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span>拟招生人数</span></strong></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span>1</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>080200</span></span></p></td><td><p><span>机械工程</span></p></td><td><p><span>全日制</span></p></td><td><p><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>10</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span>2</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>0802Z1</span></span></p></td><td><p><span>工业工程</span></p></td><td><p><span>全日制</span></p></td><td><p><span><span>10</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span>3</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>080400</span></span></p></td><td><p><span>仪器科学与技术</span></p></td><td><p><span>全日制</span></p></td><td><p><span><span>10</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span>4</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>085501</span><span>（</span><span>01</span><span>）</span></span></p></td><td><p><span>机械工程</span></p></td><td><p><span>全日制</span></p></td><td><p><span><span>56</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span>5</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>085509</span></span></p></td><td><p><span>智能制造技术</span></p></td><td><p><span>全日制</span></p></td><td><p><span><span>5</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span>6</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>085510</span></span></p></td><td><p><span>机器人工程</span></p></td><td><p><span>全日制</span></p></td><td><p><span><span>3</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>合计</span></p></td><td colspan=\"3\"><br/></td><td><p><span><span>194</span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p><span><span>注：硕士研究生实际招生人数可根据生源情况适当调整。</span></span></p><h2><span><span>三、申请、复试、录取工作安排</span></span></h2><p><span><span>学院成立推免生复试专家组，坚持公平、公正、公开原则，落实集体议事和集体决策制度，以提高选拔质量为核心，坚持全面考查、突出能力考核，强化对考生科研创新潜质和专业能力倾向的考查。复试专家组负责审核考生申请材料，确定复试名单，并根据复试成绩，结合申请材料和综合素质考核结果，对考生进行综合评价，择优录取。</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>推免工作安排包括</span><span>“学院推免预报名系统”和教育部“推免服务系统”报名确认两个阶段。</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>（一）预报名环节</span></span></p><p><span><span>预报名时间为</span>2026<span>年</span><span>9</span><span>月</span></span><span><span>16</span></span><span><span>日至</span>9<span>月</span></span><span><span>21</span></span><span><span>日</span></span><span><span>9</span></span><span>:00<span>。取得就读高校推免资格的考生，请通过预报名链接（</span></span><span><span>http://whlg.form.360eol.com/enroll/325IqyL3</span></span><span><span>）填报志愿</span></span><span><span>，并将推免资格证明（或处于推免公示期的证明材料）制成一个</span><span>PDF</span><span>文件（</span><span>10M</span><span>以内），</span></span><span><span>以</span></span><span>“</span><span><span>姓名</span>+<span>推免生</span><span>+</span><span>拟报考专业</span></span><span>及代码</span><span>”</span><span><span>命名并上传系统。学院根据报名情况在学院官网公布预报名名单。</span></span></p><h3><span><span>（二）正式报名与复试</span></span></h3><p><span>1.</span><span><span>9</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>21</span></span><span><span>日</span>9:00<span>，推免生开始报名。考生登录中国研究生招生信息网</span><span>“</span><span>全国推荐免试攻读研究生（免初试、转段）信息公开暨管理服务系统</span><span>”</span><span>（以下简称</span><span>“</span><span>推免服务系统</span><span>”</span><span>，网址：</span><span>https://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm</span><span>）填报志愿。原则上，报名截止时间为</span></span><span><span>9</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>22</span></span><span><span>日</span></span><span><span>8</span></span><span>:00<span>。</span></span></p><p><span>2.</span><span><span>9</span></span><span><span>月</span><span>2</span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span>日</span><span><span>，学院开始审核考生申请材料，并向符合条件的考生发放复试通知。</span></span></p><p><span>3.</span><span><span>9</span></span><span>月</span><span><span>23</span></span><span>日</span><span><span>，学院组织复试，开展综合能力考核。考核包括考生自述、专家提问等环节，重点考查考生的心理素质、知识结构、综合能力和科学素养等。</span></span><span><span>考核时间不超过</span><span>10</span><span>分钟，满分</span><span>100</span><span>分，成绩低于</span><span>60</span><span>分的考生，将不予录取。</span></span><span><span>复试小组由学院相关专业具有高级职称或硕士研究生导师资格的教师组成，成员不少于</span>3<span>人</span></span><span>。</span><span>具体安排如下：</span></p><p><span><span>3.1 </span></span><span>资格审核</span></p><p><span><span>时间：</span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>2</span></span><span><span>3</span></span><span>日（周</span><span>三</span><span><span>）</span><span>9:00-1</span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>:00</span><span>。</span></span></p><p><span>地点：机电工程学院一楼大厅。</span></p><p><span>审核材料：身份证、学生证，教育部系统发送的复试短信。</span></p><p><span><span>3.2 </span></span><span>面试</span></p><p><span><span>时间：</span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>2</span></span><span><span>3</span></span><span>日（周</span><span>三</span><span><span>）</span><span>14:00</span><span>开始。</span></span></p><p><span>地点：资格审查当日公布，具体考场见现场公告。</span></p><h3><span>（三）录取</span></h3><p><span>1.</span><span>在</span><strong><span>“推免服务系统”</span></strong><span>该环节开启时</span><span><span>，学院开始发放待录取通知。学院根据考核成绩，向参加复试且考核合格的考生发放待录取通知。</span></span></p><p><span>2.</span><span>在</span><strong><span>“推免服务系统”</span></strong><span>该环节开启时</span><span><span>，考生开始确认待录取通知。学院按照考生确认待录取通知的时间顺序确定接收名单，额满为止。逾期未确认的，不再保留拟录取名额。</span></span></p><p><span>3.<span>学院通过推免服务系统发放复试通知或待录取通知后，考生须在规定时间内登录系统确认。逾期未确认的，经学院电话联系确认后，学院可按规定撤回相应通知。考生接受待录取通知后，原则上不得更改。</span></span></p><p><span>4.<span>待录取工作结束后，如招生计划仍有余额，学院将根据推免服务系统中的报名情况，从已参加复试且考核合格的考生中依次补录。</span></span></p><h2><span><span>四、注意事项</span></span></h2><p><span>1.<span>所有推免生（含硕士研究生、直博生）均须通过推免服务系统完成报名、复试确认和待录取确认等程序。</span></span></p><p><span>2.<span>考生须准确填写个人信息，并在推免工作期间保持电话畅通、电子邮箱使用正常。</span></span></p><p><span>3.<span>考生须对提交材料的真实性负责。凡弄虚作假者，一经查实，取消其复试或录取资格。</span></span></p><p><span>4.<span>考生须按照教育部有关规定，于</span></span><span>规定时间内</span><span><span>，登录推免服务系统完成网上报名及报名费缴纳。</span></span></p><p><span>5.<span>考生须在推免工作期间保持通信畅通，并按要求参加复试考核。</span></span></p><p><span>6.<span>考生收到复试通知或待录取通知后，须在规定时间内登录推免服务系统确认。</span></span></p><h2><span><span>五、联系方式</span></span></h2><p><span><span>联系人：</span></span><span>王</span><span><span>老师</span></span></p><p><span><span>联系电话：</span></span><span><span>027-87218976</span></span></p><p><span><span>监督电话：</span></span><span><span>027-87859007</span></span></p><p><span><span>地址：武汉市洪山区珞狮路</span></span><span><span>122</span></span><span><span>号武汉理工大学</span></span><span>机电工程</span><span><span>学院</span></span></p><p><span><span>邮政编码：</span>430070</span></p><p><span><span>武汉理工大学</span></span><span>机电工程</span><span><span>学院</span></span></p><p><span>2026<span>年</span><span>9</span><span>月</span></span><span><span>16</span></span><span><span>日</span></span></p><p><br/></p></div>\n</div>","textSha256":"cc1414e64d166d34070bce4f22ec48ce111ab2576888569a83e3c0b40d30240f","textLength":1994,"sourceSha256":"af68345abd8b5e759027c55f1fb6f3606e3aab6d7deed1f978ce94b9a64a571e","selector":"article-like:article-box","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-8f1d8adbad07555a8337","title":"2026年武汉理工大学机电工程学院2027年推荐免试攻读硕士学位（直接攻读博士学位）研究生招生简章","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:54:10.265100+00:00"}
